    "# Notebook 1: Cohort Selection and Label Construction\n",
    "## MIMIC-IV 30-Day Readmission Prediction - Colab Arm\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective**: Create binary labels for 30-day hospital readmission using the new modular architecture following meeting notes 10/27/2025.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Architecture Alignment**: This notebook implements Step 1 from the meeting notes:\n",
    "- **Cohort Selection**: Filter admissions based on exclusion criteria\n",
    "- **Label Generation**: 30-day readmission labels with patient-wise splits\n",
    "- **Data Contracts**: Outputs `cohort.parquet`, `labels.parquet`, `splits.parquet`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key Changes from Daniel's Original**:\n",
    "- Uses new modular architecture with Hydra configs\n",
    "- Implements patient-wise splits (no leakage across subject_id)\n",
    "- Follows data contracts from meeting notes\n",
    "- Prepares for HiBEHRT + BioClinical BERT fusion pipeline"
   ]
